WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:05.155
Same hand, only the nail shape changes, and the whole look is different!

2
00:00:05.155 --> 00:00:10.722
Square, round, almond, ballerina or stiletto: which one suits you?

3
00:00:10.722 --> 00:00:14.796
Square: a straight tip and sharp corners give a modern look.

4
00:00:14.796 --> 00:00:20.970
It suits long, slim fingers. Worn very long, the corners can catch on things.

5
00:00:20.970 --> 00:00:26.480
Round follows the curve of your fingertip, and it's the most natural and strongest shape.

6
00:00:26.480 --> 00:00:31.206
It suits short nails and anyone who types a lot or works with their hands.

7
00:00:31.206 --> 00:00:35.520
Almond tapers towards a softly rounded tip, just like an almond.

8
00:00:35.520 --> 00:00:39.737
It makes fingers look longer and suits almost every hand.

9
00:00:39.737 --> 00:00:44.177
Ballerina: a tapered nail with a flat tip, like a ballet shoe.

10
00:00:44.177 --> 00:00:48.914
It's chic and distinctive, but it looks best when the nails are long.

11
00:00:48.914 --> 00:00:53.594
Stiletto: a pointed tip, the boldest and most eye-catching shape.

12
00:00:53.594 --> 00:00:58.479
It also breaks the most easily, so it's better for parties than for everyday life.

13
00:00:58.479 --> 00:01:06.937
In short: neat goes square, strong goes round, slim goes almond, chic goes ballerina, and bold goes stiletto.

14
00:01:06.937 --> 00:01:10.998
Want to try a new shape? Ask Moja Beauty which one suits your hands!

